# OCI 9.2's LOB read (OCILobRead) on a CLOB, to Oracle 8.1.7 (#2804):
# from offset 1, 64 characters asked for.
# Captured 2026-11-26 through tcpdump on the 9i VM. The TTC payload,
# without the packet's header, as `hexdump -C` output; the offset column
# and the |ascii| gutter are ignored by tests.replay.parse_hexdump.
00000000  03 60 0f 01 56 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00  |.`..V...........|
00000010  00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00  02 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000020  00 00 54 00 01 02 0c 00  00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00  |..T.............|
00000030  00 00 14 f9 57 00 04 1d  c0 00 04 1d bf 00 02 00  |....W...........|
00000040  02 00 1f 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000050  00 00 00 00 00 00 36 3a  dc 00 00 00 07 00 27 00  |......6:......'.|
00000060  00 0a f8 00 80 04 dd 02  8f 10 00 00 00 00 04 1d  |................|
00000070  bf 01 40 01 13 00 00 40  00 00 00                 |..@....@...|
